    <div class="container d-flex h-100 align-items-center">
      <div class="mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-white-50 mx-auto mt-2 mb-5">Have you ever wanted someone to talk to, but been aftraid to open up to your friends, parents, partner(s), and not wanted to face the stigma of talking to a therapist? Have you ever questioned who you really were, what you wanted and valued? </h2>
        <h2 class="text-white-50 mx-auto mt-2 mb-5">Yomonsni is a methodology of coaching to help you connect with the authenticity that is inherent within you, and to manifest it into all aspects of your life. We offer some focused areas for discovery and expression, but are just as happy to veer from any topic to cover the areas you need in a given session or package. Coaching is not about dealing with your feelings about past events, but instead is focused on where do you go from this moment forward in your life.</h2>
	<p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
        <p class="mb-0"></p>
        <h2 class="text-white-50 mx-auto mt-2 mb-5"></h2>
